    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Kittens &amp; Coffee, the ultimate tycoon game where adorable cats and the aroma of freshly brewed coffee come together in a delightful blend of fun! Manage your own cat-filled cafe, customize your shop, attract unique feline customers, and build a thriving business empire. Unleash the charm of rare special cats, unlock upgrades, and build your cozy cafe in this heartwarming tycoon adventure. It's not just a game; it's a whimsical journey where cats and coffee create the purr-fect combination for an unforgettable experience!",
